<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-djent-precision" category="High Gain" order="190" instrument="guitar" style="Djent">
  <description>Surgical djent rhythm for seven- and eight-strings: a very hard gate, a drive-at-zero overdrive and a German twin-channel high-gain head with tight lows and forward upper mids, into a V30 4x12. Every palm-muted 'djent' snaps, and odd-time stops are silent.</description>
  <tags><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Djent</tag><tag>Prog Metal</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Extended Range</tag><tag>Gate</tag><tag>Boosted</tag></tags>
